AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER
LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,
OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE
SOFTWARE.

The mascot images and the app icon (CE/icon/popsnes_mascot.bmp,
CE/icon/popsnes.ico and .github/images/popsnes_mascot_C_osanpo_4x.png)
are not covered by this MIT license: they are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
The icon was made with AI (Claude) from the Pop series mascot.

The README screenshots (.github/screenshots/) are not covered by any
license of this repository; see CE/THIRDPARTY_LICENSES.txt.

The font data (CE/ce_shinonome16.h, CE/ce_galmuri14.h, CE/ce_galmuri11.h)
is not covered by this MIT license either; see CE/THIRDPARTY_LICENSES.txt.

